  "Use Line (L), Rectangle (R), Circle (C) and the other tools. Geometry snaps to points, midpoints and horizontal or vertical directions and adds matching constraints.": "使用直线 (L)、矩形 (R)、圆 (C) 等工具绘制。几何图形会自动捕捉端点、中点及水平/垂直方向并自动添加几何关系约束。",
  "3. Constrain": "3. 标注尺寸与约束",
  "Use Smart Dimension (D) to set sizes, and the Constrain group of the Sketch tab (Coincident, Parallel, Tangent...) to fix how geometry relates. Convert Entities projects model edges into the sketch, linked to the model. Blue geometry can still move; black is fully defined; red conflicts.": "使用智能尺寸 (D) 设置尺寸，利用“约束”工具栏（重合、平行、相切等）确定几何关系。“转换实体引用”可将模型边缘投影到草图中。蓝色线可移动；黑色线完全定义；红色线过定义冲突。",
  "4. Build": "4. 生成特征",
  "Exit the sketch and use Extruded Boss, Revolved Boss or a Cut. Then add fillets, chamfers, holes, shells and patterns.": "退出草图并使用拉伸凸台、旋转凸台或切除特征。随后可添加圆角、倒角、孔、抽壳及阵列特征。",
